OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to step up patrols during
OL,4,AJewish holidays
OL,5,
OL,6,FSynagogues and surrounding areas will
OL,7,Fbe protected with an increased police
OL,8,Fpresence during the Jewish High Holy
OL,9,FDays.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said specialist
OL,12,Fresources, high-visibility patrols and
OL,13,Farmed officers would form part of a
OL,14,Fdedicated operation.
OL,16,FIt will coincide with important
OL,17,Freligious observances, starting with
OL,18,FRosh Hashanah on Friday and Yom Kippur,
OL,19,FSukkot and Simchat Torah.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
