OL,3,GNEWSAPolice to step up patrols during
OL,4,AJewish holidays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move comes as antisemitic incidents
OL,7,Fhave been rising internationally since
OL,8,Fthe Hamas attack on 7 October 2023 and
OL,9,Fsubsequent Gaza war.
